<title>USA: OMAHA HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>OMAHA HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Top $55.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs	    55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Slow, steady to weak. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US   1-3  450-500 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>US   2-3  500-650 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>US   1-3  350-450 lbs    not established</p>
